    "text": "The number of subshells associated with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;quantum numbers is:",
